  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development, in the absence of Prior Approval would exceed the depth\r\npermitted Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, &amp;nbsp;A.1(f)\r\nof The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England)\r\nOrder 2015 as amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;For\r\nthe above reasons, the proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed extension, due the staggered rear elevation of the property would\r\nresult in &amp;nbsp;cumulative enlargement to the\r\noriginal dwellinghouse that would extend beyond walls forming side elevations\r\nof the original dwellinghouse and would have a width greater than half of the\r\nwidth of the original dwellinghouse. As such, the proposal would not comply\r\nwith Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, Conditions A.1(j)(iii) and A.1(ja) of The\r\nTown and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015\r\nas amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
